  ('alternative_proof_of_identity', 'another proof of identity (or several other proofs of identity)', 'May be presented if the applicant is unable to present a personal travel document in which a visa can be affixed. For family members of a foreign national whose refugee status has been recognised by Belgium or to whom Belgium has granted subsidiary protection, applicants who do not present a valid travel document when submitting their application must prove their full identity by other means of evidence; the competent post determines the alternative documents that can be presented in the specific local context.', 'identity_travel', false, 4, 'https://dofi.ibz.be/en/themes/ressortissants-dun-pays-tiers/regroupement-familial/visa-d-application-family-reunification'),
