  ('visa_application_form', 'Visa Application Form and Photo', 'One Visa Application Form filled on-line and printed, one copy of Confirmation of Online Visa Application, one recently-taken color passport photo (white background), front view, bare-head.', 'basic_document', true, 2, 'https://lagos.china-consulate.gov.cn/eng/zytz/202409/t20240908_11487232.htm'),
  ('invitation_letter_te_or_verification', 'Relevant invitation or certification letters', 'Invitation Letter (TE) or Verification Letter of Invitation, and an invitation letter issued by an inviting individual (entity) in China. Invitation Letter (TE) or Verification Letter of Invitation should be processed by the inviting individual (entity) in China. Non-first time visitors are exempted from providing Invitation Letter (TE) or Verification Letter of Invitation. The above mentioned letter should contain: personal information on the invitee; information on the planned visit including purpose of visit, dates of arrival and departure, place(s) to be visited, itinerary, relationship with the inviting individual (entity), and financial source for expenditure; information on the inviting individual (entity) including full name, contact number, address, seal of entity, and signature of the inviting individual(s) or legal representative(s); and a clear promise that the applicant(s) shall abide by the laws and regulations while staying in China, and exit China as planned.', 'supporting_document', true, 3, 'https://lagos.china-consulate.gov.cn/eng/zytz/202409/t20240908_11487232.htm'),
  ('te_or_verification_for_non_first_time_visitors', 'Invitation Letter (TE) or Verification Letter of Invitation', 'Non-first time visitors are exempted from providing Invitation Letter (TE) or Verification Letter of Invitation.', 'supporting_document', false, 4, 'https://lagos.china-consulate.gov.cn/eng/zytz/202409/t20240908_11487232.htm'),
