  ('photographs', 'Two recent colour passport-size photographs', 'White background, size 35 x 45 mm. One photograph should be glued to the visa application and the second, bearing on the reverse side the applicant’s full name, should be attached to the application with a paper clip.', 'photo', true, 2, 'https://visa.vfsglobal.com/one-pager/italy/nigeria/english/pdf/BisinessVisa_150116.pdf'),
