  ('proof_of_funds', 'enough money to finance your stay in Norway and your return journey', 'You must be able to document that you have sufficient means to support yourself during your stay in Norway and the Schengen area. Whether your funds are considered sufficient will be assessed individually in each case. The following amounts serve as general guidelines for what is regarded as a sufficient minimum: NOK 300 per day if you will be staying with family or friends, or in accommodation that has been paid for in advance; NOK 1,300 per day if you have not documented pre-booked or pre-paid accommodation for the entire duration of your stay; if several people are travelling together, the amount should be at least NOK 1,000 per person per day.', 'financial', true, 5, 'https://www.udi.no/en/want-to-apply/visit-and-holiday/visitors-visa-to-norway/?c=nga'),
