  ('passport', 'Original passport', 'Validity shall extend at least three months after the intended date of departure from the territory of the Member States; it shall contain at least two blank pages; it shall have been issued within the previous 10 years.', 'passport', true, 2, 'https://visa.vfsglobal.com/one-pager/sweden/Nigeria/english/pdf/tourism_nigeria_checklist.pdf'),
